---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import NewsletterCTA from '../components/NewsletterCTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Find Us in Haymarket, Virginia" description="Two Spoons is growing in Haymarket, Virginia. Get updates on upcoming market appearances and request local pickup or Virginia delivery.">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEIGHBORS WITH THE SPOONS</span>
      <h1>Rooted right here.<br/><em>Ready to meet you.</em></h1>
      <p>We’re starting close to home, with a little kitchen in Haymarket and a big soft spot for our Virginia community.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="markets-grid">
      <div class="local-illustration">
        <span class="local-stamp">A LITTLE LOCAL<br/>LOVE, FROM US<br/>TO YOU ♡</span>
        <Icon name="pin" size={80}/>
        <h2>Haymarket, Virginia.</h2>
        <p>where our story is stirring.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="market-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow text-orange">SEE YOU AT THE TABLE</span>
        <h2>Good food.<br/><em>Real conversations.</em></h2>
        <p>We’re looking forward to sharing our food at local farmers markets and community events. A chance to meet, talk recipes, and hear what you think—that’s our kind of market day.</p>
        <div class="notice"><Icon name="sun"/><div><strong>Market dates are on the way.</strong><p>We don’t have confirmed appearances yet. Join the newsletter and we’ll share the where and when as plans come together.</p></div></div>
        <a class="button" href="/join">Get market updates <Icon size={18}/></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="product-facts">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-orange">A LITTLE CLOSER TO YOUR KITCHEN</span>
        <h2>Pickup &amp; delivery plans.</h2>
        <p>We’re planning local pickup in the Haymarket area and exploring delivery within Virginia. Exact locations, timing, and any delivery costs will be confirmed individually before your order is final.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ul class="idea-list"><li><Icon name="pin"/>Haymarket-area pickup requests</li><li><Icon name="bag"/>Virginia delivery requests</li><li><Icon name="heart"/>Details confirmed with a real person</li></ul>
        <a class="text-link" href="/order" style="margin-top:25px">Send an order request <Icon size={18}/></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="story-body">
      <span class="eyebrow text-orange">BRINGING PEOPLE TOGETHER?</span>
      <h2>We’d love to hear <em>about it.</em></h2>
      <p>Organizing a local market or community event? Tell us what you have in mind. We’re still planning our first appearances, and we’d love to get to know the people who make our neighborhood special.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/contact?topic=Market%20or%20event">Say hello <Icon name="mail" size={18}/></a>
    </section>
  </div>
  <NewsletterCTA/>
</Layout>
